---
// Custom Toast Notification (Google Material Snackbar)
---
<div id="toast-box" class="fixed top-20 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 z-50 hidden bg-[#202124] text-white px-4 py-2.5 rounded-full text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium flex items-center gap-2.5 shadow-[0_4px_12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.28)]">
    <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#34a853] shrink-0"></span>
    <span id="toast-message">Notification</span>
</div>
